<h2>Welcome, {{name}}!</h2>
<p>Your enterprise account has been created on the <strong>{{appName}}</strong> portal.</p>
<p>Below are your account details:</p>
<table width="100%" style="background-color: #0f172a; border-radius: 8px; margin: 20px 0; border: 1px solid #334155; padding: 15px;">
  <tr>
    <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">Employee Code:</td>
    <td style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 14px; font-weight: bold; padding: 5px 0;">{{employeeCode}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">Department:</td>
    <td style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">{{department}}</td>
  </tr>
  <tr>
    <td style="color: #64748b; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">Role Profile:</td>
    <td style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 14px; padding: 5px 0;">{{role}}</td>
  </tr>
</table>
<p>To access the system, click the button below to sign in:</p>
<div align="center">
  <a href="{{loginUrl}}" class="btn">Access Dashboard</a>
</div>
